	(text "RAILS_OK low forces every relay off and the OPA1622 into shutdown, whatever the MCU does (architecture 8): each control line is ANDed with RAILS_OK."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f7e67672-ec9f-5342-8da5-ff2e705e4f5d")
	)
	(text "100k pull-downs hold the gate drives low while 3V3_A ramps. Coil clamp: diode plus 10 V zener to 5V_DIG (drain about 16 V), so release stays near the 3 ms figure."
